      "created_at": "2017-11-06T21:03:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Today on the Digital One Deck Dungeon Kickstarter we announced that Fanatic is making a cross-over appearance!</p><p>https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/handelabra/one-deck-dungeon-digital-tabletop-game/posts/2036496</p><p>She's an early stretch goal so we hope that Sentinels fans can get on board and unlock her. What do you think her heroic feat and skill will be? How would she fare against a glooping ooze,&nbsp;<em>plague rat</em>, or the Minotaur? I'm looking forward to finding out =)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
