      "created_at": "2017-11-07T03:33:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There's a joke here about XPW Fanatic being really good against Plague Rat, but I'm not clever enough to make it.</p><p>I feel like her heroic will be something in line with the Slayer- store a heroic die when you&nbsp;defeat a combat room.&nbsp;Her 2P skill will be Embolden, letting an ally re-roll a strength or an&nbsp;agility die.&nbsp;</p><p>I'm excited to hit this stretch goal!</p>",
