      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-11-08T17:40:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Handelabra has been asked to treat One-Deck Fanatic as a Disparation variant, and specifically asked to incorporate aspects of all her existing variants into this one.&nbsp; The Swaptober variants are also official Disparation canon, so if they wanted to include, say, the Naturalist, Handelabra would not just have the option of using the Swaptober version, but technically would have a mandate to do so.</p>",
